        <p class="provenance-note">Composed by rule from Wikidata item <a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2">Q2</a> (composition/0.3, view/0.2, design/0.2). The lead paragraph, the section paragraphs and the section links come from Wikipedia. Pictures come from Wikimedia Commons; a W on a picture marks one from an article, not from Wikidata; a W on a value marks a statement whose only reference is a Wikipedia.</p><dialog id="label-editor"
        class="label-editor"
        lang="en"
        aria-labelledby="label-editor-title"
        data-saved="Saved on this page only. This is a prototype: nothing is published.">
